6. **Lock by path:** this seat starts no heavy job, takes no heavy slot and no port (any `.tools/heavy-slot-*` is another seat's: report, never touch). Python, `gh`, Jira and git-read calls only, plus the one worktree add under the git lock.
7. **This seat adds no test and no row to the code repo** ("0 test files changed").
8. **Jira writes only where this kit's scope says** (the create T1, plus the one comment on MPSCALC-325 only if slot CORR-325 says yes; no other project; no label edit; no transition; no edit).
9. **Verify before claiming done.** Every count in STATUS re-run at the end; the Jira read-back byte-equal with the mutant control; the scan 0 with its control firing; the C-entry's quoted words byte-equal to slot AUTH-112; no expectation edited to turn something green. A failure is fixed at the root and re-verified, never skipped.
